    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/5fb97a4f-5304-41b8-86c3-d5da29146913-01/SelectionCriterion$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_SelectionCriteria1>,
    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/5fb97a4f-5304-41b8-86c3-d5da29146913-01/SelectionCriterion$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_SelectionCriteria2>,
    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/5fb97a4f-5304-41b8-86c3-d5da29146913-01/SelectionCriterion$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_SelectionCriteria3>;
  epo:usesTechnique <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/5fb97a4f-5304-41b8-86c3-d5da29146913-01/DynamicPurchaseSystemTechnicalUsage$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingProcess1>;
  dct:description """The Procurement Office of the City of Reykjavik, on behalf of the Environment and Planning Department, is planning to tender for the construction of portable classrooms to be placed on a plot of land in Laugardalur, Reykjavik, next spring/summer.
Currently, the project involves the construction and installation of 2 portable classrooms, as well as a connecting corridor. The final number of classrooms may be increased to 11.
The classrooms must meet all necessary requirements to obtain a building permit and must comply with all building regulations related to educational facilities.
Each classroom unit is approximately 80 m², on a single floor. The final scope of the connecting corridor will be clarified later. The classroom units should be made of wood / wooden structure. Each unit must be transportable as a whole and placed on the plot, to be connected with the corridor. Each unit will include a classroom for 20 students, a restroom, and an entrance hall.
"""@en;
  dct:title "16085 Færanlegar kennslustofur fyrir skólaþorp í Laugardal,  EES útboð "@en;
